CLI.md §2.2, DECISIONS 143: a directory whose files declare several packages is a usage error, named as typed.
-- args --
check
a
./mixed/
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a
-- mixed/one.canon --
package mixed
-- mixed/two.canon --
package a
-- want --
[exit 2]
[stdout]
[stderr]
canon: unknown package: ./mixed/: its files declare several packages
